==================================================
1. PRODUCT VISION
==================================================

SETPIECE by PerformIQ is a football set-piece execution system.

It helps coaches:
- create set pieces quickly
- assign exact roles to players
- share each player’s task via QR/mobile
- verify player understanding before matchday
- manage substitutions without chaos
- create printable and shareable matchday outputs

This is NOT just a tactics whiteboard.
This is a workflow product for planning, assigning, communicating, learning, and executing set pieces.

Main launch promise:
“Create set pieces in minutes, send them to players via QR, and make sure everyone understands their role.”

==================================================
2. PRODUCT STRATEGY
==================================================

Build this as:

- Coach/Admin = Web App
- Player experience = PWA (Progressive Web App)
- Backend = Firebase
- Architecture = future-native-ready

Important:
The player app must be built as a PWA first.
It should feel app-like on mobile and be installable.
Later, it should be possible to rebuild or extend the player experience as a native app without rewriting the whole business logic.

Therefore:
- keep business logic separate from UI
- keep shared schemas and domain logic reusable
- keep player flows simple and portable
- do not tightly couple core logic to browser-only hacks

The tactical editor remains WEB-FIRST.
Do NOT try to force the full editor into a native-mobile-first architecture.

